        "TileImage": "$($repository 3da55f86-d94c-4ff7-9eee-06d7fdf11829).Image",
        "Description": "Good work on framing Papa Meat with that gory massacre. With its main supplier in trouble, La Carne has gotten sloppy in encrypting an upcoming business deal. The main targets are Valeria R, one of the cult&apos;s best lieutenants, who is meeting Vianna B, an Ether scientist selling a new killswitch virus that kills its victims fast but leaves them safe for consumption. You must eliminate the 2 women, along with Vianna&apos;s bodyguard, the local courier Gina, and the exit facilitator Reginaldo. Good luck",
